[
    {
        "content": "<p>Hi all,<br>\nIs there any easy way to get <code>roc test --watch</code> to give nice coloured output like <code>roc test</code> does?<br>\nThanks,<br>\nSimon.</p>",
        "id": 642170398,
        "sender_full_name": "Simon Redding",
        "timestamp": 1795170643
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Hi Simon,<br>\nCan you try this: <code>FORCE_COLOR=1 roc test --watch</code></p>",
        "id": 642199576,
        "sender_full_name": "Anton",
        "timestamp": 1795177426
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>That works.<br>\nThank you.</p>",
        "id": 642200792,
        "sender_full_name": "Simon Redding",
        "timestamp": 1795177698
    }
